{53}{Oh, these days I don't do too much. A little huntin' - a little fishin'. I was part of the construction crew that built a place out on the lake called Vormantown. When the job was finished, I decided this would be a nice place to retire to and built me a house here.}{Oh, these days I don't do too much. A little huntin' - a little fishin'. I was part of the construction crew that built a place out on the lake called Vormantown. When the job was finished, I decided this would be a nice place to retire to and built me a house here.}{}{}{}{}
{54}{Someone built a town on the lake? A floating town?}{}{5}{}{57}{}
