{57}{No, no. You see, there's three islands out in the middle of the lake. A feller named Vorman bought one and built him a town on it. A pack a dwarves have been busy guttin' the south island while a band of Elves have been livin' on the northern-most one forever.}{No, no. You see, there's three islands out in the middle of the lake. A feller named Vorman bought one and built him a town on it. A pack a dwarves have been busy guttin' the south island while a band of Elves have been livin' on the northern-most one forever.}{}{}{}{}
